cuit Theory and Applications.", "Michael Brown (2023). Introduction to Digital Logic Design Using Simulation Tools. Journal of Engineering Education."], "rencana_pembelajaran": [{"materi": "Pengenalan Sistem Digital dan Bilangan Digital", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 1, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-1", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Perbedaan Sistem Bilangan Biner dan Desimal serta Konversi", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 2, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-4", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Gerbang Logika Dasar (AND, OR, NOT)", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 3, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-5", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Aljabar Boolean dan Penyederhanaan Ekspresi Logika", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 4, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-2", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Hukum-hukum Aljabar Boolean", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 5, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-6", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Penyederhanaan Ekspresi Logika Menggunakan Tabel Kebenaran", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 6, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-3", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Peta Karnaugh untuk Penyederhanaan Ekspresi Logika", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 7, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-7", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Operasi Rangkaian Adder Satu Bit", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 9, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-10", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Rangkaian Decoder 2 ke 4", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 10, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-11", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Rangkaian Multiplexer 4 ke 1", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 11, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-12", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Identifikasi Komponen Dasar Rangkaian Logika dalam Software Simulasi", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 12, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-13", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Merancang Rangkaian Logika Sederhana Menggunakan Software Simulasi", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 13, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-14", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Proyek Akhir: Desain Rangkaian Logika Kompleks", "met