ian menggunakan MATLAB/Simulink", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 14, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-13", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Analisis respons frekuensi dari rangkaian yang telah disimulasikan", "metode": "Praktikum, Diskusi", "minggu": 15, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-14", "penilaian": "Ujian Kecil"}, {"materi": "Ujian Akhir Semester", "metode": "Ujian Tertulis/Online", "minggu": 16, "subCpmk": "UAS", "penilaian": "Ujian"}], "referensi_pendukung": ["M. Khan (2021). Analysis of Three-Phase AC Circuits Using MATLAB. Journal of Electrical Engineering.", "A. Smith (2023). Frequency Response Analysis of Electrical Circuits. International Journal of Electrical Engineering Education.", "R. Patel (2022). Design and Simulation of Filters in MATLAB. Journal of Circuit Theory and Applications.", "T. N. Nguyen (2024). Application of Laplace Transform in Circuit Analysis. IEEE Transactions on Power Electronics."], "rencana_pembelajaran": [{"materi": "Analisis Rangkaian AC Tiga Fasa - Konsep dasar dan pengukuran", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 1, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-1", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Prinsip dasar dan karakteristik sistem rangkaian AC tiga fasa", "metode": "Ceramah, Praktikum", "minggu": 2, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-4", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Menghitung daya aktif, reaktif, dan apparent dalam rangkaian AC tiga fasa", "metode": "Diskusi, Latihan Soal", "minggu": 3, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-5", "penilaian": "Ujian Kecil"}, {"materi": "Rangkaian Resonansi - Resonansi seri dan paralel", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 4, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-2", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Menganalisis kondisi resonansi dalam rangkaian RLC", "metode": "Praktikum, Diskusi", "minggu": 5, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-6", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Merancang dan menganalisis rangkaian filter (seri dan paralel)", "metode": "Praktikum, Diskusi", "minggu": 6, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-3", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Hukum Kirchhoff dan analisis phasor pada ra