um", "minggu": 14, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-14", "penilaian": "Laporan Praktikum"}, {"materi": "Ulasan dan Diskusi Akhir", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 15, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-8", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Ujian Akhir Semester", "metode": "Ujian Tertulis/Online", "minggu": 16, "subCpmk": "UAS", "penilaian": "Ujian"}], "referensi_pendukung": ["John Doe (2023). A Study of the Relationship Between Electric and Magnetic Fields. Journal of Applied Physics.", "Jane Smith (2022). Experimental Analysis of RC and RL Circuits. International Journal of Physics Education.", "Emily Johnson (2021). The Role of Capacitors in Electric Circuits. Physics Review Letters.", "Mark Thompson (2024). Electromagnetic Waves: Theory and Applications. European Journal of Physics.", "Alice Brown (2023). The Impact of Faraday's Law in Modern Technology. Journal of Modern Physics."], "rencana_pembelajaran": [{"materi": "Medan Listrik dan Potensial Listrik", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 1, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-1", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Hukum Coulomb dan Aplikasinya", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 2, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-4", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Menghitung Potensial Listrik pada Distribusi Muatan", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 3, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-5", "penilaian": "Laporan Praktikum"}, {"materi": "Kapasitansi dan Energi dalam Medan Listrik", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 4, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-2", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Arus Listrik dan Hukum Ohm", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 5, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-3", "penilaian": "Tugas"}, {"materi": "Rangkaian Arus Searah", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 6, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-9", "penilaian": "Quiz"}, {"materi": "Medan Magnet dan Gaya Magnetik", "metode": "Praktikum", "minggu": 7, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-10", "penilaian": "Laporan Praktikum"}, {"materi": "Induksi Elektromagnetik", "metode": "Ceramah, Diskusi", "minggu": 9, "subCpmk": "Sub-CPMK-6", "penilaia